* SiPAP safety cutoff - 5V rail at 4.75 V (MPX5010 Vs min, NXP DS 5.0 +/-0.25 V)
* Sensor ratiometric: Vout = V(5V)*(0.09*P+0.04); P ramp 0 -> 3.5 kPa -> 0 (PWL on node PK, 1 V = 1 kPa)
.INCLUDE "C:\Users\ADMIN\EDA Agent\workspace\spice\lm393.lib"
.OPTIONS ITL4=200 RELTOL=0.003 METHOD=GEAR
V5 5V 0 DC 4.75
V12 VIN12V 0 DC 12
VP PK 0 PWL(0 0 10m 3.5 20m 0)
ESENS RAWSRC 0 VALUE={V(5V)*(0.09*V(PK)+0.04)}
RSRC RAWSRC PRESS_RED_RAW 1
C12 PRESS_RED_RAW 0 470p
R3 PRESS_RED_RAW ADC 10k
R4 ADC 0 20k
R10 5V REF 47k
R11 REF 0 10k
XU7 ADC REF 5V 0 COMP LM2903B
CPAR COMP 0 10p
R18 COMP ADC 1MEG
R17 GATE COMP 10k
R13 GATE VIN12V 10k
CQ1 GATE VIN12V 2.06n
R15 COMP TRIP 1MEG
R16 TRIP 0 330k
.TRAN 5u 20m 0 10u
.PLOT TRAN V(PK) V(GATE) V(TRIP)
.END
